- Safe cleanup of abandoned drafts.

Never automatically delete a currently active learner's unsynchronised work.

When clearing a local draft, make sure the user is not losing their only copy of a project.

## F. Avoid unnecessary reads and listeners

Do not create permanent Firestore listeners for editor state.

Do not repeatedly read assessment documents when the required information has already been loaded and safely validated.

Do not read user roles from Firestore repeatedly during every image operation when a suitable controlled strategy exists, while still verifying access appropriately on every sensitive request.

